00:35:48.740 --> 00:35:52.940
if this is happening
across GSK globally

00:35:52.940 --> 00:35:58.420
or if it's your team is
also US-based or UK-based.

00:35:58.420 --> 00:35:59.020
Oh, yeah.

00:35:59.020 --> 00:36:04.420
So as I said maybe earlier
when very few people were on,

00:36:04.420 --> 00:36:07.600
despite my very American
accent, I live in the UK.

00:36:07.600 --> 00:36:08.830
It's dark outside.

00:36:08.830 --> 00:36:10.040
It's the end of my day.

00:36:10.040 --> 00:36:11.710
So I'm blaming
everything on the fact

00:36:11.710 --> 00:36:13.420
that it's almost-- it's 5:30.

00:36:13.420 --> 00:36:14.920
I'm checked out.

