00:36:20.680 --> 00:36:23.230
GSK is one global company.

00:36:23.230 --> 00:36:26.740
So we as the biostatistics
department for all of GSK

00:36:26.740 --> 00:36:28.600
support all of GSK.

00:36:28.600 --> 00:36:31.150
My department is
