00:36:46.990 --> 00:36:52.000
And yeah, we work for all of the
biostatistics department in GSK

00:36:52.000 --> 00:36:55.240
but also in other departments
within GSK as well.

00:36:55.240 --> 00:36:57.070
Yeah.

00:36:57.070 --> 00:36:57.570
Cool.

00:36:57.570 --> 00:36:59.680
Thank you.

