So when I talk about
tables, I talk--

00:37:36.270 --> 00:37:41.790
I mean demographics table
as in the number of people

00:37:41.790 --> 00:37:46.350
who are goes male,
female, and goes,

00:37:46.350 --> 00:37:49.800
here's the age cut, that
like mean age, max age,

00:37:49.800 --> 00:37:51.840
mean age, what--

00:37:51.840 --> 00:37:53.230
by treatment.

00:37:53.230 --> 00:37:54.690
So it is like the standard.

00:37:54.690 --> 00:37:56.070
It's like a standard.

00:37:56.070 --> 00:37:58.710
It's different
for every company.

00:37:58.710 --> 00:38:00.930
But it is a table
that we give out

00:38:00.930 --> 00:38:06.190
for every study that
has ever run at GSK,

00:38:06.190 --> 00:38:08.970
or you can have specifics
for like the table that

