is for your particular
stats analysis

00:38:11.310 --> 00:38:12.850
for your particular study.

00:38:12.850 --> 00:38:16.360
But when I talk about tables,
I mean like that sort of table.

00:38:16.360 --> 00:38:23.370
And that table we can create
in R cannot create in R--

00:38:23.370 --> 00:38:25.330
it doesn't really matter--

00:38:25.330 --> 00:38:29.010
and then needs to get formatted
